{%- comment -%}
  Single switch for the top Bizmis demo banner and the header offset reserved for it. On.
  The URL hides it in the browser (Liquid can't read the query string): ?nobar and the recording links (?intro=,
  promo_video, marketing=) set html.no-bizmis-bar (layout/theme.liquid), which hides the bar and its space (no gap).
  Widget, demo panel, and install CTAs are independent.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bizmis_top_banner_enabled = true
-%}
{%- if bizmis_top_banner_enabled and settings.bizmis_demo_enabled -%}
  {%- if mode == 'class' -%}has-promo-bar{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
